WEBVTT

00:11:30.162 --> 00:11:34.954
I really enjoyed changing my mind because
I enjoy being surprised and

00:11:34.954 --> 00:11:37.704
I enjoy being surprised because
I feel I'm learning something

00:11:37.996 --> 00:11:40.579
so that it's been that way.

00:11:40.579 --> 00:11:43.662
I've been lucky, I think, because
I think you're right,

00:11:43.746 --> 00:11:51.037
that this is not universal, the positive
emotion to correct and mistakes.

00:11:51.412 --> 00:11:53.371
But it's just a matter of luck.

00:11:53.371 --> 00:11:57.496
I mean, I'm not, you know, not claiming
high moral ground here.

00:11:59.371 --> 00:12:01.204
It's it's fascinating to watch, though,